  "task": {
    "objective": "Wardens aim to immobilize every courier still inside. Couriers aim to get both pennants out, one carried pennant per escaping courier, while keeping their partner available for rescue.",
    "natural_termination": "Both couriers escaped, or every nonescaped courier is currently frozen. If one has escaped and the other is tagged, the wardens end the remaining chase. Otherwise truncate at 96 steps. Frozen timers last at most six steps without retagging; an episode can end earlier. Terminal raw state is absorbing.",
    "interaction": "Workers occupy a courtyard with two routes around a wall. Tagging drops carried cargo and removes the target's next actions. A nearby courier can free the partner with grace before the tag phase. Both couriers draw from the same regenerating shelter charges; wardens can seal those physical shelters. Exiting removes a possible rescuer while also securing a payoff.",
    "observation_access": "Same-team workers are always radio-visible. Opponents are visible only within Manhattan distance three; walls do not block this proximity sensor. Pennants are visible within the same radius or when carried by a teammate; delivered pennants are inactive. The static map, shelters, exit, shelter resources and identity-only event announcements are public. Hidden worker and pennant coordinates and attributes are masked exactly as listed; the renderer must honor agent_vis and flag_vis."
  },
